Facet includes third-party material:

MediaPipe canonical face model
  packages/metrics/third_party/mediapipe/canonical_face_model.obj, and the files derived from it:
  packages/metrics/facet_metrics/data/canonical_face.json and apps/web/src/lib/face/canonical.json
  Copyright The MediaPipe Authors. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe

At run time the web app loads the MediaPipe Tasks Vision runtime (npm package
@mediapipe/tasks-vision) and the face landmarker model (face_landmarker.task), both Apache-2.0.
They are fetched at install time by apps/web/scripts/sync-mediapipe.mjs and are not committed.
